---
description: Fuse demo rules
alwaysApply: true
---

The demo must begin with the problem, show a real or honestly labeled simulated
failure, show the policy, show the blocked next invocation, show persisted
evidence, show recovery or replay, and show a normal successful run. Keep the story
under three minutes. Do not show planned services as implemented.

Public demo: synthetic invoice data only, allowlisted scenarios, no arbitrary
prompts or tools. Label estimated cost as estimated. Distinguish enforcement from
monitoring, and blocked-next-call from cancellation.
